# Atlas — hiring lifecycle state machine (Sprint 05)
# Login first (see auth.http) and paste the bearer token below.
# You also need a quote id (see quotes.http) — an engagement starts from one.

@host = http://localhost:5000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@quoteId = PASTE_QUOTE_ID_HERE

### Start a hire from a quote (HR manager or org admin) → 201
# Country + pay come from the quote; the role title and hours are the hire's own.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quoteId": "{{quoteId}}",
  "roleTitle": "Senior Engineer",
  "weeklyHours": 40
}

### The engagement, with its onboarding checklist and (empty) timeline
GET {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send the offer to a named candidate: Quote → Offer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/send-offer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateName": "Maria Santos",
  "candidateEmail": "maria.santos@example.com"
}

### Candidate accepts on a calendar date: Offer → Contract
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/accept-offer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acceptedOn": "2026-08-01"
}

### Complete onboarding items (the first one starts onboarding: Contract → Onboarding)
# Item names are the slugs from GET /{id} — e.g. contract-signed, id-verified,
# bank-details, and for Germany, works-council-notification.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/checklist/contract-signed/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/checklist/id-verified/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/checklist/bank-details/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/checklist/works-council-notification/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry a completed item → still 200, idempotent (no second activity row)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/checklist/contract-signed/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activate: Onboarding → Active. Creates the Worker + initial terms in one commit.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The worker the activation created (follow createdWorkerId from the response above)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workers/PASTE_WORKER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Try to activate before onboarding is complete → 422 (business rule violated)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_UNFINISHED_ENGAGEMENT_ID/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Withdraw (legal only from Offer or Contract) → Withdrawn
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ENGAGEMENT_ID/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Candidate accepted another role"
}

### Illegal transition: withdraw once onboarding started → 422 problem+json
POST {{host}}/api/v1/engagements/PASTE_ONBOARDING_ENGAGEMENT_ID/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "too late"
}

### List engagements (org-scoped, newest-first cursor pagination)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/engagements?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
